flowchart TD
  A[(Results from all seeds)] --> B[Tidy table<br/>seed × algorithm × metric]
  B --> C[Summary: mean, std,<br/>95 % CI, median]
  B --> D[Paired differences<br/>Adaptive − baseline per seed]
  D --> E{Baseline ≈ 0?}
  E -- no --> F[Relative change %<br/>+ absolute difference with CI]
  E -- yes --> G[Absolute difference only]
  F & G --> H[Wilcoxon signed-rank p-value]
  C & H --> I{Evidence type}
  I -- simulation --> J[Label: simulation]
  I -- real execution --> K[Label: hardware]
  J & K --> L[(RESULTS.md, CSVs, plots)]
